From ad81f5a052f916b0c6d138517756e9241398f1eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:39:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Discord bridge: staff groups in the link summary (groupIds)
 for the bot's staff roles

link.redeem, link.account and link.list now include groupIds: the distinct groups
(data/XML/groups.xml) of the account's characters, ascending, with the live group
for online characters. The group is per character (players.group_id); accounts.group_id
is not used because pokeverse_set_group never lowers it. The bot gives the Discord role
of the highest staff group (Tutor to God).

Test: Link Alpha is a Tutor in test-server-linux.sh; the bridge test checks groupIds
after linking and after the second character is deleted.
---
